# Cistern Hall's overflow channel (CIPlay cistern_hall_acid, 11-11; in a test world 'CI ...', under CIGapsWatchHealth,
# no CIGapsSuit). Points as in its recipe (the origin frame): the channel's mouth at hill 1's south foot at 62 -61.5,
# dug in to 62 -53.5 and its small room to 62 -49.5; the acid zone ch_overflow at 62 -57 (r 3, safe=suit); the suit box
# at 53 -62.5 and the warning sign at 54 -61 west of the mouth; the overflow valve at 70.8 -62.5 east of it; the overflow
# locker at 63.2 -50.2. Without the suit the floor burns; the valve hides the zone, then the floor is safe. The suit run
# is cistern_hall_acidsuit.
island Cistern Hall keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture ch_flow_out 62 5 -71 62 3.5 -60
# In without a suit: the sludge burns
expect shown chflowacid
at 57 -61.5
walk 57 -61.5 to 62 -61.5 to 62 -57
wait 5
expect message acid sludge
expect hurt 15
picture ch_flow_in 62 4.6 -61 62 3.8 -55 light=20
walk 62 -57 to 62 -61.5 to 57 -61.5
# (the way out is through the acid too: counted here, so the dry walk below starts from none)
expect hurt 1

# Along the bank to the valve: the sludge goes, the floor is safe
walk 57 -61.5 to 69 -62
use chflowvalve
wait 2
expect hidden chflowacid
# (set back where the first walk started: the walk to the valve shows the bank's way; walked back over the mouth's
# lip, the walker slips off the bank's edge to the beach)
at 57 -61.5
walk 57 -61.5 to 62 -61.5 to 62 -57 to 62.4 -51.4
wait 5
expect unhurt
open Overflow locker
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
